WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
Bill C-7 — MAID Expansion.

00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:06.637
The most consequential legislation of a generation.

00:00:06.637 --> 00:00:10.650
Removed the requirement that death be reasonably foreseeable.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.175
Created Track 2 for non-terminal conditions.

00:00:14.175 --> 00:00:18.637
732 non-terminal people killed in the first year.

00:00:18.637 --> 00:00:21.137
The UN called for repeal.

00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:24.887
10 provinces oppose the mental illness expansion.

00:00:24.887 --> 00:00:31.312
The PBO calculated it saves 149 million per year — published before the vote.
